  "prefLabel": "Pod 104.01 Record of Official Actions",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-05-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 104.01 Record of Official Actions. Minutes shall be kept of all board meetings and all official actions taken by the board. These minutes shall record those members who participate in each vote and shall separately record the position of any members who choose to dissent, abstain, or concur. Board minutes of actions which are not confidential under RSA 91-A:3, II or RSA 91-A:5 shall be public records and shall be available for inspection during the board's ordinary office hours.\n\nSource. #5391, eff 5-8-92, EXPIRED: 5-8-98\n\nNew. #7816, eff 1-7-03; ss by #14372, eff 9-19-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pod100-500.html"
